ass, education, occupation and hours-per-week as duplicates, and keep the first one.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_dedup_005", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "deduplication", "difficulty": "hard", "request": "Remove duplicates based on age, education, marital-status, occupation, relationship, race and sex. Keep the first record of each group.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_dedup_006", "split": "dev", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "deduplication", "difficulty": "medium", "request": "Remove records that are identical in every column except fnlwgt and income, keeping the first.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_001", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "easy", "request": "Remove everyone younger than 18 from the dataset.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_002", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "medium", "request": "Drop the records of people who work more than 60 hours a week.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_003", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "medium", "request": "Keep only the people whose native country is United-States.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_004", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "medium", "request": "Remove the people whose education level is Preschool or 1st-4th.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_005", "split": "test", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "hard", "request": "Remove self-employed people (incorporated or not) who are older than 60.", "data_file": "data/adult_dev.csv"}, {"id": "adult_filt_006", "split": "dev", "dataset": "adult", "transformation_type": "filtering", "difficulty": "hard", "request"